From 73169963de8e592c92bd8191adb7b9d1bed129ec Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: WPE <wpe@localhost>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 19:12:07 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Add --control-stdin: pointer, buttons and pause from the
 host; make GLUT optional

Hosts that show the window where it never gets real input (a GNOME Shell
extension cloning it into the desktop background) forward the pointer and
pause state over stdin, one command per line:
  m <x> <y>, b <l|r> <0|1>, p <0|1>, q. EOF on stdin quits as well.

GLUT is only linked, never used, so it is no longer required.
